OL,3,GNEWSAFirefighter's emotion after 9/11
OL,4,Astair challenge
OL,5,
OL,6,FA firefighter from Shropshire has
OL,7,Fdescribed the emotion of joining more
OL,8,Fthan 1,200 colleagues in a memorial
OL,9,Fstair climb honouring firefighters who
OL,10,Flost their lives in the 9/11 attacks.
OL,12,FKat Frost was among almost 300
OL,13,Ffirefighters from the UK and Ireland
OL,14,Fwho travelled to Atlanta, Georgia, to
OL,15,Ftake part in the United 9/11 Memorial
OL,16,FStair Climb at baseball stadium Truist
OL,17,FPark.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,356,350,200,160,0,100
