OL,3,GNEWSAFirefighter's emotion after 9/11
OL,4,Astair challenge
OL,5,
OL,6,FLast weekend, participants climbed 110
OL,7,Fflights of stairs in full fire kit in
OL,8,Ftemperatures of about 35C and high
OL,9,Fhumidity, replicating the ascent made
OL,10,Fby firefighters during the attacks on
OL,11,Fthe World Trade Center in New York in
OL,12,F2001.
OL,14,F"It was emotional, but it was an
OL,15,Famazing experience," Frost said.
